## Note for the operator (no action needed)

The overlay's "Gates" section still says a cold cache "can fail once ... (task 1790622959); a rerun passes. Leave it off only for task 1790622959 itself". That is now stale: ICP_LEDGER_WASM only saves a fresh worktree one download. I edited the seat's copy, found it is a symlink to the primary's untracked `.antler/factory-overlay.md`, and restored the original text so the primary was not changed outside factory.sh. Suggested replacement for those lines: "It saves a fresh worktree one download; without it the harness fetches the pinned module into its own target/money-safety/ cache. (Until task 1790622959 landed, a cold cache could fail the money-safety step once; fixed on main.)"

